---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Services" description="One-off AI integration projects, Elixir and Phoenix builds, and AI-assisted engineering for teams.">
  <section class="hero">
    <h1 class="star">Services</h1>
    <p>I take on a small number of projects at a time and do the work myself. No account managers, no hand-offs.</p>
  </section>
  <div class="services">
    <section class="service">
      <h2 class="star">AI integration <strong>projects</strong></h2>
      <p>A fixed-scope project to put AI to work on one real problem in your business: support triage, document extraction, an assistant over your own data, a workflow that runs itself.</p>
      <ul><li>Scoped, priced and delivered as a single project</li><li>Built to run in production, not just demo</li><li>Evaluation, cost controls and monitoring included</li></ul>
    </section>
    <section class="service">
      <h2 class="star">Elixir &amp; <strong>Phoenix</strong></h2>
      <p>New builds, rescues and second opinions on Elixir systems. LiveView, Ecto and PostgreSQL, Oban, CQRS and event sourcing, payments.</p>
      <ul><li>Greenfield apps and features</li><li>Performance and test-suite speedups</li><li>Architecture reviews</li></ul>
    </section>
    <section class="service">
      <h2 class="star">AI-ready <strong>engineering</strong></h2>
      <p>Helping teams adopt coding agents without trading away quality: specs, guardrails, review and the delivery pipeline around the code.</p>
      <ul><li>Agent workflows and deterministic guardrails</li><li>CI/CD and Continuous Delivery coaching</li><li>DORA-style measurement</li></ul>
    </section>
  </div>
  <p style="margin-top:3rem"><a class="btn" href="/contact/">Start a conversation</a></p>
</Base>
